&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: center"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐ明朝&amp;apos;; font-size: 10px"&gt;概要&lt;/span&gt;
